Scott Colom has become the first Black person to win a Senate race in Mississippi since 1874 and the first Democrat to do so since 1982 after being declared the victor in a razor-edge election on Wednesday. The win is a stunning upset in one of the country’s most reliably red states, adding to what were already sweeping gains by the Democrats at the midterms.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3ade5db6-de9c-11f1-a25d-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/Colom-midterms-vignette.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3ade5db6-de9c-11f1-a25d-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/Colom-midterms-vignette.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0eca4dfc-de9c-11f1-9e41-418d1d65c605</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:37:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Perspective</category><title>War photographer Patrick Chauvel: 'People have lost faith in the press'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/perspective/20261112-war-photographer-patrick-chauvel-people-have-lost-faith-in-the-press</link><description>
One of France's top war photographers, who has a 50-year CV of taking pictures in and around conflicts across the planet, has spoken to FRANCE 24 about his concerns that people have lost faith in the press. He notes that journalists are only looking for the truth. Patrick Chauvel has produced nearly 380,000 photographs, from Vietnam to Cambodia, from Afghanistan to Palestine, from Lebanon to Ukraine. He says he wants to take people by the hand to show them how the press works and why.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/100c1ede-de9c-11f1-82c5-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-0fb797a8.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/100c1ede-de9c-11f1-82c5-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-0fb797a8.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">80879002-de7a-11f1-a3cf-c9f658457713</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:33:46 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Stuart NORVAL</dc:creator></item><item><title>🔴Live: Putin offers to evacuate civilians from eastern Ukraine's Kostiantynivka</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261112-live-us-envoys-to-meet-putin-and-zelensky-after-abu-dhabi-talks</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">2d9619d0-de99-11f1-b823-73c3e3320c78</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:02:30 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Focus</category><title>Israeli occupation in southern Lebanon: Displaced families struggle to cope</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/focus/20261112-israeli-occupation-in-southern-lebanon-displaced-families-struggle-to-cope</link><description>
In Lebanon, more than 360,000 people are still displaced after months of war between Israel and Hezbollah, according to the UN. Along the border, the Israeli army claims to be fighting the Iran-backed militant group but now occupies 6 percent of Lebanese territory and is wiping entire villages off the map. In the border area, we meet families living in makeshift housing. Many fear they may never go home.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/38e48628-ddf9-11f1-82b6-3f371022a770/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-NW-OOV-FREEZE-LEBANON-ISRAELI-OCCUPATION-BAIN-Lauren-Sub.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/38e48628-ddf9-11f1-82b6-3f371022a770/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-NW-OOV-FREEZE-LEBANON-ISRAELI-OCCUPATION-BAIN-Lauren-Sub.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d7e34142-ddf9-11f1-ba1f-d72171b1cb65</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:51:05 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Sophie GUIGNON</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
